flowchart LR
  source[Source-declared facts] --> adapter[Parser / Adapter]
  adapter --> ir[Document Form IR authority]
  ir --> canonical[Canonical IR bytes]
  canonical --> digest[IR content digest]
  canonical --> index[Rebuildable index projection]
  rendered[Rendered/OCR observation] -. observation only .-> ir
  ir -. facts only .-> semantic[Downstream Semantic IR]
  sourceBytes[Original file bytes] -. outside IR .-> metadata[Ingestion metadata]
  metadata -. execution context only .-> adapter
